// The Nardah Hunter Shop, Artimeus's (hunter_desert.npc): https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Nardah_Hunter_Shop
// Open since 21 November 2006. The wiki's stock and amounts, less what this build does not have or does
// differently: the butterfly net is this build's small fishing net (the net butterflies are caught with
// here - see hunter.constant), butterfly jars are blown rather than bought, and the magic box, the rabbit
// snare and the three trap packs (later additions) are not stocked.
[nardah_hunter_shop]
scope=shared
size=40
restock=yes
stackall=yes
allstock=no
stock1=net,5,50
stock2=noose_wand,50,50
stock3=hunter_bird_snare,50,50
stock4=hunter_box_trap,25,50
stock5=teasing_stick,5,50
stock6=torch_unlit,20,50
